<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">La Pampa Province</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">La <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/adikavi-pampa">Pampa</a> is a province of central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/argentina">Argentina</a>, with its capital at Santa Rosa, covering part of the pampas plains and the drier lands to the west. Until the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/conquest-of-the-desert">Conquest of the Desert</a> of 1878–1879 it was largely held by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ranquel">Ranquel</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mapuche">Mapuche</a> peoples. It was organised as a national territory in 1884 and became a province in 1951.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/la-pampa-province.jpg" alt="La Pampa Province" width="320" height="180" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Hardscarf · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Parque_Nacional_Lihu%C3%A9_Calel.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
